# Dynamic-attach (no-flag injection) spike — evidence (2026-07-10)

## Case A wall 1: attach to a RUNNING MC fails — MC drops SIGQUIT
  MC at menu SigCgt=0x16003  -> SIGQUIT(bit2,0x4) NOT caught
  plain JVM (Sleeper) SigCgt=0x101005ccf -> SIGQUIT caught (attach works)
  VirtualMachine.attach(mcPid) -> AttachNotSupportedException: state is not ready to participate in attach handshake

